Z||000001||RobertVol||03-31-2001||01:54 AM||||Even though your not a girl  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>I will help ya. <P>Lets see start with all the normal things and that are usually the problems<P>Ignition coil is alot times the main culprit on this stuff. <P>Cap, rotor, Plugs, Distibutor.any one of thes things could be it<P>I just replaced the Ignition coil because of the same symptoms.<P>Ran GREAT afterwards<P>Hope this helps! <P>------------------<BR>Robert<BR>88GT 56k T TOP  <BR>North Florida Fiero Club <A HREF="http://fullspeed.to/NorthFLFieros" TARGET=_blank>http://fullspeed.to/NorthFLFieros</A><BR> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=819451&a=5959473&p=36934984&Sequence=1"> ||||reg||12
